onsumer-led premiumization trends which we believe will enable us to help deliver improved performance within this segment of our busines…", "a": "said Bill Newlands, President and CEO, Constellation Brands", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/16918/000001691825000064/stzex991_060220258k.htm"}, {"d": "2025-04-14", "n": 4.26, "z": -0.14, "rz": 1.47, "q": "We sincerely thank Kris for the significant contributions to our business and culture she has made in her nearly 12 years with the company, and we wish her the very best in her new endeavors,", "a": "said Bill Newlands, Constellation’s President and Chief Executive Officer", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/16918/000001691825000019/stzex991_41420258k.htm"}, {"d": "2025-02-18", "n": 2.0, "z": -1.0, "rz": 1.36, "q": "Yuri made a difficult decision to leave Constellation Brands to pursue a life-long career goal and we wish him the very best in his future endeavors,", "a": "said Bill Newlands, President and Chief Executive Officer at Constellation Brands", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/16918/000001691825000010/stzex991_21820258k.htm"}], "now": null}, "score": {"value": 43, "verdict": {"it": "Leggermente ribassista", "en": "Mildly bearish"}, "confidence": "Media", "covered_pct": 80, "missing": ["guid"], "subs": [{"id": "insider", "name": {"it": "Insider", "en": "Insiders"}, "w": 35, "v": 38, "why": [{"it": "Nessun acquisto discrezionale negli ultimi 90 giorni.", "en": "No discretionary purchase in the last 90 days."}, {"it": "Flusso netto pesato sullo storico: -261.11 M$.", "en": "Net flow weighted by track record: -261.11 M$."}], "coverage": "Alta"}, {"id": "guid", "name": {"it": "Guidance e tono", "en": "Guidance and tone"}, "w": 20, "v": null, "why": [{"it": "Serve l'export delle trascrizioni delle call.", "en": "Needs the export of the earnings-call transcripts."}], "coverage": "Assente"}, {"id": "market", "name": {"it": "Mercato", "en": "Market"}, "w": 15, "v": 47, "why"